            "review_title": "Review at KimSushi",
            "review_text": "ElDee1986\nMelbourne, Australia229 contributions\n0\nFantastic sushi and Japanese fare, although not cheap\nJan 2018\nCame here for lunch while wandering around Times City. Good, prompt service. They have a wide range of Japanese dishes including sushi, sashimi, noodles, miso and more. We had a selection of different dishes including California roll, assorted sashimi and miso noodles and all were delicious. Price was higher than average Vietnam restaurant, but on par with costs in Times City.\nRead more\nWritten January 11, 2018",
